sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant React as React App
    participant Zustand as Zustand Store
    participant Axios as Axios Client
    participant Spring as Spring Boot
    participant Security as Spring Security
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Service as Service
    participant Repository as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User, DB: Authentication Flow

    User->>React: Enter credentials
    React->>Zustand: login(email, password)
    Zustand->>Axios: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    Axios->>Spring: HTTP Request
    Spring->>Security: Validate credentials
    Security->>DB: Find user by email
    DB-->>Security: User data
    Security->>Security: Verify password (bcrypt)
    Security-->>Spring: JWT Token
    Spring-->>Axios: 200 OK + Token
    Axios-->>Zustand: Auth Response
    Zustand->>Zustand: Store token in localStorage
    Zustand-->>React: Update auth state
    React-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard

    Note over User, DB: Create Client Flow

    User->>React: Fill client form
    React->>Zustand: createClient(data)
    Zustand->>Axios: POST /api/v1/clients
    Note right of Axios: Authorization: Bearer {token}
    Axios->>Spring: HTTP Request
    Spring->>Security: Validate JWT
    Security->>Security: Extract companyId
    Spring->>Controller: Handle request
    Controller->>Controller: Validate DTO (@Valid)
    Controller->>Service: createClient(dto)
    Service->>Service: Business validations
    Service->>Repository: save(client)
    Repository->>DB: INSERT INTO clients
    DB-->>Repository: Saved entity
    Repository-->>Service: Client entity
    Service-->>Controller: ClientResponseDTO
    Controller-->>Axios: 201 Created
    Axios-->>Zustand: Client data
    Zustand->>Zustand: Update clients list
    Zustand-->>React: Re-render
    React-->>User: Show success message

    Note over User, DB: Fetch Clients Flow

    User->>React: Navigate to clients list
    React->>Zustand: fetchClients(page, search)
    Zustand->>Axios: GET /api/v1/clients?page=1&search=John
    Axios->>Spring: HTTP Request
    Spring->>Security: Validate JWT
    Security->>Security: Extract companyId
    Spring->>Controller: Handle request
    Controller->>Service: getClients(page, search, companyId)
    Service->>Repository: findByCompanyId(companyId, pageable)
    Repository->>DB: SELECT * FROM clients WHERE company_id = ?
    DB-->>Repository: Result set
    Repository-->>Service: Page<Client>
    Service-->>Controller: Page<ClientResponseDTO>
    Controller-->>Axios: 200 OK + Paginated data
    Axios-->>Zustand: Clients response
    Zustand->>Zustand: Update state
    Zustand-->>React: Re-render
    React-->>User: Display clients table

    Note over User, DB: Error Handling Flow

    User->>React: Submit invalid form
    React->>Zustand: createClient(invalidData)
    Zustand->>Axios: POST /api/v1/clients
    Axios->>Spring: HTTP Request
    Spring->>Security: Validate JWT
    Spring->>Controller: Handle request
    Controller->>Controller: Validation fails
    Controller-->>Axios: 400 Bad Request + Errors
    Axios-->>Zustand: Error response
    Zustand->>Zustand: Set error state
    Zustand-->>React: Re-render with errors
    React-->>User: Show validation errors
